sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Next.js (:3000)
    participant BE as Spring Boot (:8080)
    participant Email as Email (logged)

    User->>FE: Click "Tắt MFA" on Profile page
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/users/mfa/disable/send-otp
    BE->>BE: Generate 6-digit OTP, hash with BCrypt
    BE->>BE: Save MfaChallenge (userId, type=DISABLE, expiresAt)
    BE->>Email: Send OTP to user's email
    BE-->>FE: { message: "OTP sent" }
    FE->>FE: Show OTP input form
    FE-->>User: "Mã OTP đã gửi đến email"

    User->>FE: Enter 6-digit OTP
    FE->>BE: DELETE /api/v1/users/mfa { code }
    BE->>BE: Find MfaChallenge (type=DISABLE)
    BE->>BE: Validate OTP (not expired, attempts < 5)
    BE->>BE: user.mfaEnabled = false
    BE->>BE: Delete all MfaChallenges for user
    BE->>BE: Delete all RecoveryCodes for user
    BE-->>FE: { message: "MFA disabled" }
    FE->>FE: Update local user state
    FE-->>User: MFA disabled ✓
